---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
const repo = 'https://github.com/heggria/flowgate'
---
<BaseLayout title="FlowGate — macOS 开源代理工作区" description="把订阅、节点、分流规则和实时连接放在同一个工作区。FlowGate 基于 sing-box，面向 Apple Silicon Mac，目前提供开发预览。" image="https://heggria.github.io/images/flowgate-icon.png" imageAlt="FlowGate 应用图标">
  <div class="page-width flowgate-page">
    <header class="fg-hero">
      <div class="fg-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK / 002 · macOS</p>
        <h1>FlowGate<span>.</span><br>把连接理清楚。</h1>
        <p class="fg-description">订阅、节点、分流规则、实时连接。<br>把代理管理放在同一个工作区，少在设置之间来回找。</p>
        <div class="fg-tags"><span>Apple Silicon</span><span>sing-box</span><span>GPL-3.0-or-later</span></div>
        <div class="case-links"><a class="button-primary" href={`${repo}/releases`}>查看开发预览 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={repo}>GitHub 源码 ↗</a></div>
        <p class="fg-preview-note">开发预览 · 安装包尚未完成 Apple Developer ID 签名与公证。当前以手动 HTTP / SOCKS 代理模式使用。</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="fg-art">
        <div class="fg-art-top"><span>FLOWGATE</span><span>PROXY WORKSPACE</span></div>
        <img src="/images/flowgate-icon.svg" width="178" height="178" alt="FlowGate 应用图标" />
        <div class="fg-route" aria-label="功能示意：订阅和节点经过规则分流，形成可观察的连接">
          <div><span>01 / INPUT</span><strong>订阅与节点</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
          <div><span>02 / ROUTE</span><strong>规则与分流</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
          <div><span>03 / OBSERVE</span><strong>连接与统计</strong></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>功能结构示意 · 非应用截图</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <section class="fg-capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
      <div class="section-label"><div><span class="section-number">01 / THE WORKSPACE</span><h2 id="capabilities-title">从配置到连接，放在一起。</h2></div></div>
      <div class="fg-features">
        <div><span class="fg-number">01</span><h3>整理可用的连接</h3><p>管理订阅与节点，查看测速结果，再决定使用哪个节点。订阅和节点需要自行配置。</p><span class="fg-feature-label">SUBSCRIPTIONS / NODES</span></div>
        <div><span class="fg-number">02</span><h3>看清流量怎么走</h3><p>配置规则集与分流，管理独立 DNS 和接口出口，把不同连接的走向理清楚。</p><span class="fg-feature-label">RULES / DNS / ROUTING</span></div>
        <div><span class="fg-number">03</span><h3>连接之后还能检查</h3><p>在工作区查看实时连接和流量统计，结合诊断信息排查问题。</p><span class="fg-feature-label">CONNECTIONS / DIAGNOSTICS</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fg-status" aria-labelledby="status-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / CURRENT STATE</p><h2 id="status-title">正在打磨，<br>欢迎提早参与。</h2><p>如果你使用 Apple Silicon Mac，愿意尝试开发版本，或想参与桌面网络工具的开发，可以从这里开始。</p></div>
      <dl>
        <div><dt><span class="fg-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>目前可用</dt><dd>手动 HTTP / SOCKS 代理、订阅与节点管理、测速、规则分流和实时连接统计。当前构建默认不接管系统网络。</dd></div>
        <div><dt>仍在完成</dt><dd>系统代理 / TUN 的 helper 已实现，但签名安装与真实系统接管验收尚未完成。正式签名、公证和分发流程仍需完善。</dd></div>
        <div><dt>使用前了解</dt><dd>FlowGate 是代理客户端，需要你提供订阅或节点。公开下载目前为开发预览包；具体要求与更新以仓库和发布说明为准。</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="fg-start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
      <div class="section-label"><div><span class="section-number">03 / GET INVOLVED</span><h2 id="start-title">从一次实际使用开始。</h2></div></div>
      <div class="fg-start-grid">
        <a href={`${repo}/releases`}><span class="fg-number">01 / PREVIEW</span><h3>查看开发预览 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>阅读版本说明，确认 Apple Silicon 构建要求和当前限制。</p></a>
        <a href={`${repo}#启动`}><span class="fg-number">02 / BUILD</span><h3>从源码运行 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>跟随 README 准备开发环境，运行工作区与 sing-box 内核。</p></a>
        <a href={`${repo}/issues`}><span class="fg-number">03 / FEEDBACK</span><h3>反馈一个具体问题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>带上版本、复现步骤与预期行为。日志中的订阅地址和凭据请先隐去。</p></a>
      </div>
      <p class="fg-source-note">项目信息核对于 2026-10-02 · <a href={repo}>README</a> · <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/ACCEPTANCE.md`}>验收进度</a> · <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}>参与开发</a></p>
    </section>
    <a class="fg-back text-link" href="/work/">← 查看其他项目</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .fg-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:72px;padding:64px 0 70px;align-items:center}
  .fg-intro h1{font:500 clamp(42px,4.6vw,68px)/1.28 var(--display);letter-spacing:-2px;margin:24px 0}
  .fg-intro h1>span{color:var(--accent)}
  .fg-description{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
  .fg-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px 18px;margin:28px 0;font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}
  .fg-tags span{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px}
  .case-links{align-items:center;gap:26px}
  .fg-preview-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);max-width:440px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:19px}
  .fg-art{margin:0;padding:27px 32px 23px;background:#152c32;color:#eaf8f3;border:1px solid #365157;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .fg-art-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;font:10px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#b2ccc8;letter-spacing:1px}
  .fg-art>img{display:block;width:156px;height:156px;margin:14px auto 4px}
  .fg-route{max-width:285px;margin:0 auto}
  .fg-route>div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid #456268;background:#1b343a}
  .fg-route span{font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#a5c3bf;white-space:nowrap}
  .fg-route strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
  .fg-route>i{display:block;text-align:center;font:17px/1.7 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#82e4ce}
  .fg-art figcaption{text-align:center;font:10px/1.8 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#a5c3bf;margin-top:22px;letter-spacing:.5px}
  .fg-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:42px;padding:12px 0 45px}
  .fg-number{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1px}
  .fg-features h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:500;margin:22px 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
  .fg-features p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);max-width:335px}
  .fg-feature-label{display:block;font:10px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px}
  .fg-status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:80px;background:var(--paper);padding:42px 45px;margin:24px 0 64px}
  .fg-status h2{font-size:34px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:20px 0}
  .fg-status>div>p:last-child{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);max-width:300px}
  .fg-status dl{margin:0}
  .fg-status dl>div{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .fg-status dl>div:first-child{padding-top:0}
  .fg-status dl>div:last-child{border:0;padding-bottom:0}
  .fg-status dt{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .fg-status dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}
  .fg-status-dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%}
  .fg-start-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
  .fg-start-grid>a{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s}
  .fg-start-grid>a:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--paper);color:var(--text)}
  .fg-start-grid h3{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;margin:21px 0 13px}
  .fg-start-grid p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
  .fg-source-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:2;margin-top:24px}
  .fg-source-note a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .fg-back{display:inline-block;margin-top:40px}
  @media(max-width:1100px){.fg-hero{gap:38px}.fg-art{padding-inline:24px}.fg-status{gap:40px}.fg-start-grid{gap:16px}.fg-start-grid>a{padding:22px}.fg-start-grid h3{font-size:18px}.fg-features{gap:30px}}
  @media(max-width:850px){.fg-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px;padding-block:45px}.fg-art{max-width:530px;width:100%}.fg-intro h1{font-size:57px}.fg-features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.fg-features>div{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:25px}.fg-features h3{margin-top:15px}.fg-features p{max-width:600px}.fg-feature-label{margin-top:15px}.fg-status{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding:32px}.fg-status>div>p:last-child{max-width:550px}.fg-start-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fg-start-grid h3{font-size:22px}.fg-start-grid p{max-width:580px}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.fg-hero{padding-top:35px}.fg-intro h1{font-size:43px;letter-spacing:-1.4px}.fg-description{font-size:16px}.fg-tags{font-size:11px;gap:12px}.case-links{gap:20px}.fg-art{padding:22px}.fg-art-top{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.4px}.fg-art>img{width:130px;height:130px}.fg-route>div{padding:15px 12px;gap:10px}.fg-route strong{font-size:14px}.fg-route span{font-size:9px}.fg-status{padding:25px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:40px}.fg-status h2{font-size:29px}.fg-source-note{font-size:11px}.fg-start-grid>a{padding:23px}.fg-start-grid h3{font-size:20px}}
  @media(max-width:360px){.fg-intro h1{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-1px}}
</style>
